# NOTE: `ios/` and `android/` are COMMITTED, not ignored. They were ignored here
# from when capacitor.config.ts was added and no platform existed yet. A native
# project is not a build artifact: it carries the app icons, the bundle id, the
# version wiring and the signing config, and CI cannot build a release without
# it. Universal_AI tracks its ios/ for the same reason. Capacitor's own
# per-platform .gitignore files already exclude the genuinely generated parts
# (build/, Pods/, the copied web assets under App/App/public and
# app/src/main/assets/public).

# TypeScript incremental build artifacts
*.tsbuildinfo

# Per-user Claude Code settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# Local test fixture, not part of the app
public/sample.pdf

# Internal project notes — not published (matches the other Universal Apps repos)
CLAUDE.md

